  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Democracy Commission Small Grants Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Democracy Commission Small Grants Program: The U.S. Embassys Democracy Commission gives small grants to local NGOs engaged in building the social and intellectual foundations of democracy, the democratic resolution of problems and the institutionalization of open, pluralistic political processes. All proposals are given a technical review in Washington, D.C., prior to a grant being issued by the Embassy.</narrative>
  </description>
